The ACME http-01 webroot. nginx serves /.well-known/acme-challenge/ from here (conf.d/coach.conf)
and the host's certbot writes the challenge token into it — see docs/deploy.md §3. The directory has
to exist in the checkout because docker-compose bind-mounts it; keeping it empty and tracked is what
makes `certbot --webroot` work on a fresh clone instead of 404ing.
